  "persona": "",
  "subject": "a granddaughter spending one dry, windy Hsinchu winter on the rooftop with her living grandmother making sun-dried radish (菜脯): weeks of salting, turning the radish morning and night on bamboo trays in the northeast 'nine-descending' wind, while the grandmother talks about working the salt pans and the salty radish grandpa brought when he first came courting",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien shoegaze in the early-1990s British style. Layered reverb-drenched electric guitars with tremolo-arm bends and a dense sustained wash; warm fuzz bass; soft roomy drums with washy cymbals; a faint organ drone underneath. Warm, blurred wall-of-sound mix with the vocal low and soft. A breathy female vocal singing close and unhurried, half-buried in the guitars. 92 BPM, D major. Hazy, tender and windswept. No pop vocal upfront, no autotune, no trap drums, no EDM synths, no metal distortion.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n十一月 阿嬤叫我起去頂樓\n菜頭排規列 白白佇竹篩仔頂\n九降風 對北爿吹過來\n吹甲阮兩个 頭毛亂亂\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n伊無講欲按怎做\n干焦講 風來矣 就好\n\n[Chorus]\n九降風 九降風\n吹予菜頭 慢慢軟去\n阿嬤的話 一句一句\n佮鹽 做伙揉入去\n\n[Verse]\n透早翻一擺 暗時翻一擺\n伊講少年時 佇鹽埕做工\n講阿公頭擺來 提一包菜脯\n伊笑講 彼包 鹹甲食袂落\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n日頭落山 風猶未歇\n阮共竹篩仔 收入來\n\n[Chorus]\n九降風 九降風\n吹予菜頭 縮甲細細\n阿嬤的話 一句一句\n囥佇甕仔內 慢慢鹹\n\n[Verse]\n第三禮拜 菜頭變金色\n伊的手 比菜脯閣較皺\n伊講 你的手 嘛會變按呢\n我講 好啊 我無要緊\n\n[Bridge]\n風吹過頂樓 吹過阮兩个\n伊講 毋免寫 鼻就知\n\n[Chorus]\n九降風 九降風\n吹到過年 甕仔滇矣\n阿嬤閣講 明年猶原\n頂樓 咱兩个\n\n[Outro]\n甕仔 閣加一層",
